        "original_id": "9d70bf54-9156-55e0-84bf-dce6deac0fb5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Signet Jewelers, Zale Corporation, Sterling Jewelers\n- Products: Zales, Kay Jewelers, Jared\n- Places: Delaware, United Kingdom, New York Stock Exchange\n\nFacts:\n- In 1987, Signet Jewelers acquired Sterling Jewelers, making Sterling Jewelers a wholly owned subsidiary of UK-based Signet Jewelers Limited.\n- In 1993, Zale Corporation was incorporated in Delaware as an American jewelry retailer.\n- Signet Jewelers owns and operates the companies Zales, Kay Jewelers, and Jared.\n- Signet Jewelers Limited is listed on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol SIG.",
